      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Why Owners Choose Seascape</h2>
      <p>Owners in the Bradenton-Sarasota corridor usually are not looking for a lecture on what property management is. They are trying to decide who will actually watch the details, protect the guest experience, and keep revenue decisions grounded in the local market.</p>
      <p>That is the gap Seascape is built to close. We combine premium guest-facing presentation with local operating discipline, so the page does not promise luxury while the back end runs like a spreadsheet project.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Local vendor coordination and response instead of distant “ticketing” culture</li>
        <li>Pricing and positioning decisions based on Gulf Coast demand, not generic national averages</li>
        <li>Owner visibility into what is driving bookings, reviews, and margins</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
